# -------------------- START --------------------
dracopedia.title.start=§6§lDragon Mounts 2 Guidebook
dracopedia.body.start=§eWelcome, Adventurer!§r\n\n§fChoose a section below to begin your journey.

dracopedia.button.how_to_play=§aHow To Play
dracopedia.button.credits=§bCredits
dracopedia.button.dragons=§dDracopedia

# -------------------- HOW TO PLAY --------------------
dracopedia.title.how_to_play=§a§lHow To Play
dracopedia.body.how_to_play=§6Finding Dragons:§r\n§fWild dragons are gone, but their eggs remain.\nTame them with §araw fish§f (not pufferfish).\n\n§6Taming & Riding:§r\n§f- Tame with §araw fish\n§f- Open inventory while riding\n§f- Breed with raw fish\n§f- §aJump to fly§f, use movement keys to steer\n\n§6Special Items:§r\n§f- §bDragon Amulet§f: Store your dragon\n§f- §bDragon Whistle§f: Summon tamed dragon\n§f- §bDragon Wand§f: Magic combat staff\n§f- §bVariant Orbs§f: Change appearance\n§f- §bDiamond Shears§f: Shear dragons\n\n§6Eggs:§r\n§fInteract to hatch (~20 mins)\n§fConvert above blocks (~5 mins)

# -------------------- CREDITS --------------------
dracopedia.title.credits=§b§lCredits
dracopedia.body.credits=§6§lDevelopers:§r\n§f- §bTomanex§f (Lead Concept Artist)\n§f- §bJDSKoala§f (Dragon Models & Animation)\n§f- §bGrummboy2§f (Lead Coder)\n§f- §bMoaswies§f (Assistant Coder)\n\n§6§lArtists:§r\n§f- §bEquinoxTheWolf§f (Dragon Textures)\n\n§6§lTranslators:§r\n§f- Tomohiko (§aJapanese§f)\n§f- Moaswies (§dChinese§f)\n§f- ShinyIllager (§bRussian§f)\n§f- Mr. Goofy (§2Vietnamese§f)\n\n§6§lSpecial Thanks:§r\n§f- TheRPGAdventurer\n§f- LegitDragonb0y\n§f- NightScale5755\n§f- EeveeDragon25 / MiahDragon

# -------------------- DRACOPEDIA (MAIN PAGE) --------------------
dracopedia.title.dragons=§d§lDracopedia
dracopedia.body.dragons=§7Browse the known dragon species.\n§8Select a dragon to reveal its lore.

# -------------------- DRAGON PAGES --------------------
dracopedia.title.aether=§dAether Dragon
dracopedia.body.aether=§fBorn in the highest skies, the Aether Dragon commands the winds.\nLegends say it guards the path to forgotten realms.

dracopedia.title.dark=§8Dark Dragon
dracopedia.body.dark=§fA creature of shadow, feared by even the bravest.\nIts breath extinguishes light and spreads despair.

dracopedia.title.ender=§5Ender Dragon
dracopedia.body.ender=§fThe ancient ruler of the End.\nWhispers claim it was the first dragon ever to be created.

dracopedia.title.enchant=§9Enchant Dragon
dracopedia.body.enchant=§fSteeped in magic, this dragon radiates energy.\nIts scales shimmer like enchanted books.

dracopedia.title.fire=§cFire Dragon
dracopedia.body.fire=§fBorn from flame, it breathes scorching infernos.\nIts nest is often found near volcanoes.

dracopedia.title.forest=§2Forest Dragon
dracopedia.body.forest=§fA protector of woods and wildlife.\nIt blends into the trees, unseen until it wishes otherwise.

dracopedia.title.ice=§bIce Dragon
dracopedia.body.ice=§fDwelling in frozen peaks, its icy breath can freeze rivers.\nSailors fear its presence near glaciers.

dracopedia.title.nether=§4Nether Dragon
dracopedia.body.nether=§fForged from lava and brimstone, it thrives in fire.\nSome say it cannot survive long outside the Nether.

dracopedia.title.sculk=§3Sculk Dragon
dracopedia.body.sculk=§fSilent as the Deep Dark, it senses vibrations.\nMiners say its roar echoes like the Warden’s cry.

dracopedia.title.skeleton=§7Skeleton Dragon
dracopedia.body.skeleton=§fA reanimated husk of a dragon long dead.\nIts bones rattle with every movement.

dracopedia.title.storm=§9Storm Dragon
dracopedia.body.storm=§fCrackling with thunder and lightning.\nIts roar summons tempests across the land.

dracopedia.title.sunlight=§eSunlight Dragon
dracopedia.body.sunlight=§fA radiant beast bathed in light.\nSaid to bless lands it flies over with prosperity.

dracopedia.title.terra=§2Terra Dragon
dracopedia.body.terra=§fSolid as the mountains, it embodies the strength of stone.\nFarmers believe its steps make crops grow.

dracopedia.title.water=§3Water Dragon
dracopedia.body.water=§fGraceful and swift beneath the waves.\nIt commands the tides and protects the deep.

dracopedia.title.wither=§8Wither Dragon
dracopedia.body.wither=§fInfused with decay, its breath spreads wither.\nA rare and dangerous mutation of dark power.

dracopedia.title.zombie=§2Zombie Dragon
dracopedia.body.zombie=§fA dragon brought back from death.\nIts flesh rots, yet it still seeks prey with hunger.

# -------------------- BUTTONS --------------------
dracopedia.button.back=§c← Back
